const prompt = `You are a senior culinary journalist and food science writer for texasdadcooks.com. Write a COMPLETELY ORIGINAL, deeply researched, and ultra-engaging cooking article in English.

INSPIRATION TOPIC: "${topic}"
${context ? `BRIEF CONTEXT: "${context.substring(0,500)}"` : ''}
${sourceContent ? `REFERENCE (for inspiration ONLY — DO NOT COPY): "${sourceContent.substring(0,1200)}"` : ''}

🔴 MANDATORY CATEGORY ASSIGNMENT 🔴
You MUST write this article for category: ${forcedCatId} = ${forcedCatName}
Adapt the topic to fit naturally within the "${forcedCatName}" category.

CRITICAL WRITING RULES:
- Write a 100% ORIGINAL article — do NOT copy any text from the reference.
- English only. Warm, friendly, conversational yet authoritative tone.
- Target length: 1200 to 1500 words TOTAL — Be extremely verbose, detailed, and comprehensive.
- NEVER summarize. Avoid short bullet points; prioritize deep-dive paragraphs.
- Include REAL food science (e.g. Maillard reaction, emulsification, hydration levels) and nutritional insights.
- Each H2 section: AT LEAST 3 to 4 long, high-value paragraphs. Make it feel human-written.
- Include specific measurements, temperatures (°F/°C), and timing.
- NEVER mention Wikipedia or Wikimedia by name.

OUTPUT — write EXACTLY this structure:

TITLE: [YOUR OWN unique long-tail SEO title initiated with a strong keyword]
CATEGORY: ${forcedCatId}
SLUG: [direct SEO-friendly slug, max 100 chars]
META: [SEO meta description 130-155 chars]
TAGS: [tag1],[tag2],[tag3],[tag4],[tag5],[tag6]
EXCERPT: [2 compelling sentences that hook the reader]
FEATURE_QUERY: [Pixabay search: 3-5 specific keywords for the main header image]
QUERY1: [Pixabay search: 3-5 keywords for finished dish/result]
QUERY2: [Pixabay search: 3-5 keywords for specific raw ingredients]
QUERY3: [Pixabay search: 3-5 keywords for cooking action/process]

===START===

<p>[Strong opening hook about this dish — make it long and evocative.]</p>

<h2>The Rich History and Cultural Roots of This Dish</h2>
<p>[3-4 detailed paragraphs about origin and evolution.]</p>

<h2>Why This Recipe Works: The Food Science Behind It</h2>
<p>[3 dense paragraphs explaining the science.]</p>

<h2>Complete Ingredient Breakdown and Selection</h2>
<p>[Detailed section explaining the role of each ingredient.]</p>

<h2>Step-by-Step Instructions for Culinary Perfection</h2>
<p>[A detailed guide on how to prepare the dish from start to finish.]</p>

<h2>Expert Tips from Years of Kitchen Experience</h2>
<p>[Detailed paragraphs of expert advice and common pitfalls.]</p>

<h2>Nutritional Benefits and Health Insights</h2>
<p>[3 paragraphs about nutrition and dieting context.]</p>

<h2>Final Thoughts and Serving Suggestions</h2>
<p>[Warm closing and encouragement.]</p>

===END===`;

